# NAME: Apple Intelligence / Siri (screenshot-based)
# FORMAT: Loon Remote Rule; select the policy in Loon.
# TOTAL: 17 (13 DOMAIN, 4 DOMAIN-SUFFIX)
# Sources: https://support.apple.com/en-us/101555
#          https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/tree/master/rule/Loon/iCloudPrivateRelay
# apple-dns uses .net; gspe1 contains digit 1, not lowercase L.
# ls.apple.com also covers Maps/location; apps.mzstatic.com serves app assets.
# Routing only: no MITM, scripts, rewrites, or guarantee of feature availability.

# Siri
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com

# iCloud Private Relay / Apple DNS
DOMAIN,mask-api.fe.apple-dns.net
DOMAIN,mask-api.icloud.com
DOMAIN,mask-t.apple-dns.net
DOMAIN,mask.apple-dns.net

# Apple Intelligence / Private Cloud Compute
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com

# Other endpoints included in the screenshot
DOMAIN,gateway.icloud.com
# Kept explicitly for comparison; also covered by ls.apple.com below.
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ls.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mask-h2.icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mask.icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com
DOMAIN,apps.mzstatic.com
